  "details": "As of SDK v3.7.4 & SDK v3.7.5, Client sim only adds one `Client Sim Udon Helper` per GameObject.\n\nThis means that only the first script on said object can function as it does in the VRChat client.\n\nThe most recent SDK version that works as it should is v3.7.3",
